    "provinceDeepAtlasProfile": {
      "oneLine": "Aelvanyr is centered at -27.313990, -56.824724 under Participatory Democracy, with 159,684,000 people across 10 settlements.",
      "extremeAtlasDescription": "Aelvanyr occupies 7,447,338.49 sq mi / 19,288,518.14 sq km of modeled Earth-sized territory, about 3.781574% of Belavadös's surface. It is not merely a province but a continent-scale civic machine: Partial forest, Farming and Deep forest define its broad terrain, while its settlements intensify into Farming, Partial forest and Beach and grass with water. Population density is 8.279 people/sq km / 21.442 people/sq mi, which lets wilderness, roads, faction-held corridors, and vast uncrowded borders remain huge.",
      "peopleFactionsAndFaith": "The strongest public people-groups are Humans, Near-Humans, and Mixed Heritage, Halfling and Smallfolk, Animalfolk and Mammalian Anthropomorphs, Dwarven and Gnomish Kin, Elf Parent Race and Elf Bloodlines, Amphibious and Aquatic Peoples, and 2 more. Frequently recorded peoples include Human, Halfling — Lightfoot Halfling, Harengon, Halfling — Stout Halfling, Kender, Kithkin, Centaur, Giff, and 4 more. Faction visibility leans toward The Freeblade Veil, with worship and patronage records naming Nebyrr, Ishtanora, Iskareth, Thalunesh, Asethyr, Marduthor, Sigrananna, and 3 more.",
